abstract: "District-level environmental information for Ghana from public satellite, climate, soil and biodiversity records: rainfall, soil moisture, vegetation, fires, fire probability, tree cover loss, observed flooding, built-up area, recorded species, cropland, main crops and topsoil properties."
keywords:
  - Ghana
  - remote sensing
  - drought
  - fire
  - biodiversity
  - agriculture
  - soil
